From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] deepseek: CPU at-risk history and cohort verification policy

No dev RPC or GPU confidence allocator. Opt-in via verification profile;
explicit VLLM_DSV41_HISTORY_POLICY=0 preserves fixed KS.

